<title>UK: Pressac gains on profit rise, outlook.</title>
<headline>Pressac gains on profit rise, outlook.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Pressac gained 6-1/2 pence to 211-1/2 after the supplier of electronic components reported better-than-expected profits, which were accompanied by a bullish trading statement.</p>
<p>Pressac's full-year pretax profit soared 40 percent to 6.4 million stg, while market forecasts had centred on 6.1 million stg, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;Demand for group products is at record levels and the new trading year has commenced well,&quot; said Pressac's chairman Roger Boissier.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
